+	# 一眼看出「那具尸体上那台已经报废，场上还在猎人的只剩另一台」。
+	if v is SpineBreakerPlayer and v.spine_breaker_light != null:
+		v.spine_breaker_light.light_color = MP8_RETIRE_LIGHT
